  "body": "Calling all Architects & Developers - $839,000 - Land Only.\r\n\r\n**Professionals Real Estate looks forward to welcoming you home.**\r\n\r\nPerched in an elevated position with sweeping views across the Hauraki Gulf to Rangitoto Island, this exceptional 1,027sqm (more or less) freehold section presents an increasingly rare opportunity to secure one of Torbay's premium coastal sites.\r\n\r\n**Attention Agents: Bring your buyers - we offer competitive conjunctional rates to all agencies.**\r\n\r\nProperties of this calibre seldom become available. Whether you're planning to create your forever home or a luxurious coastal retreat, this outstanding site provides the perfect foundation to bring your vision to life.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of being just minutes from Long Bay Regional Park, Browns Bay Village, beautiful beaches, quality schools, cafés and local amenities, while returning home to breath-taking sea views and spectacular sunsets.\r\n\r\n**Do you need to sell in order to purchase? There may be some flexibility with this listing - get in touch to discuss options.**\r\n\r\nThe generous landholding offers the potential of an elevated building platform with ample space to create a home that takes full advantage of the stunning outlook. Purchasers should undertake their own investigations regarding any geotechnical or building requirements associated with future development.\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for a premium coastal section in one of Auckland's most desirable seaside suburbs, this is an opportunity not to be missed - Call Ed Scanlan at Professionals Real Estate today - 021 814 578\r\n\r\n**Experienced. Trusted. Consistent. Local Professionals.**\r\n\r\n**We believe real estate should be done better. Higher standards, clear communication, and proven systems are the reason our clients trust us to deliver, time and time again.**\r\n\r\n**If you are buying, selling, or looking for a better way to manage property, we would love to help. Backed by Meros Group, delivering a complete property solution - Sales, Rentals, Home Staging and Concierge.**\r\n\r\n**It's time for higher standards.**",
